#: templates/Analysis/dashboard.html:28
msgid "Dashboard Overview & Navigation"
msgstr "عروض لوحة التحكم"

#: templates/Analysis/dashboard.html:31
msgid ""
"This dashboard provides a comprehensive overview of your file analysis "
"system with real-time statistics and visualizations"
